export default function ReglagesScreen() {
  const { email, signOut, isPreview } = useSession();
  const router = useRouter();

  async function handleSignOut() {
    await signOut();
    router.replace("/login");
  }

  return (
    <Screen scroll edges={[]}>
      <View style={styles.section}>
        <Text style={styles.label}>Compte</Text>
        <Text style={styles.value}>{email ?? "—"}</Text>
        {isPreview ? <Text style={styles.hint}>Mode aperçu actif (développement uniquement).</Text> : null}
      </View>
      ...
    </Screen>
  );
}
```
Use `Card` for each. Add app version, API URL. `process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` is inlined. Show it.

Logout button at bottom with `variant="danger"`.

Need a confirm? For now direct logout. Fine.

Let me write update + all screens.

